  "description": "Bean qou-sgv5 4-step diagnostic probe: proves why the chi-*-matrix-m sign-only wire family gives tr_M(p) == tr_M(n) and tr_M(T) == tr_M(3He) identically by construction (_word_for_braid_word_3a reads sign from the constant c=+1 field and discards d), verifies that all 11 matrix-m witnesses carry isospinDegeneracyNote and pn_split_carried=False, and cross-checks against the exact-triple Hoefsmit / closed-form Wenzl bridge routes where Delta tr_M(n-p) != 0 and Delta tr_M(3He-T) != 0.",
